  "content": "# 光标增强扩展\n\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"默认\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"指针手型\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"抓取\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"文字输入\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Shift键\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"忙碌\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"禁止\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"十字准星\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"全部调整\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"水平调整\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"垂直调整\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"左上右下调整\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"右上左下调整\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" />\n\n用 Minecraft 主题的光标替代乏味的旧系统默认光标。\n\n此前在 1.21.9 版本引入大量破坏性改动前，该模组曾名为 [Minecraft Cursor](https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md)。\n\n## 📌 需求\n\n- 使用 Fabric 加载器时：需安装 Fabric API\n\n## ✨ 功能\n\n- 通过资源包自定义光标纹理。\n- 用自定义动画让光标活起来。\n- 包含其他场景适用的额外光标形状。\n- 通过 [**旧版模式**](https://fishstiz.github.io/minecraft-cursor-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started#all-cursors) 增强各种 GUI 元素的光标逻辑。\n- 根据喜好调整多种选项。前往模组界面或通过 选项 › 控制 › 鼠标设置 › 光标设置 进行设置。\n\n![cursors_extended](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/o5fhgLeQ/images/6d6d002908e179dbfe11096af85f1f9a37d71189.gif)\n\n## 🖌️ 创建资源包\n\n制作你自己的资源包，在支持的平台上分享，并有机会 [在此](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase) 展示！\n\n<a href=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"展示\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"基岩版风格光标\"/>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n已经为 Minecraft Cursor v3 制作了资源包？使用 [**V3 转换器**](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/tools/#v3-converter) 进行转换。\n\n从此处开始：https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
